WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:06.000
Notes spin towards square targets floating in open space, with a ring in the centre of the field.

00:06.000 --> 00:12.000
Lines fan out in a starburst while a staircase of yellow bars sweeps down the left side.

00:12.000 --> 00:18.000
Two square targets sit side by side in a grid as notes burst around them.

00:18.000 --> 00:24.000
The field shrinks into a white photo frame, and yellow bars form crossing diagonal rows.

00:24.000 --> 00:30.000
The frame shrinks further into a small print in the middle of the screen.

00:30.000 --> 00:36.000
A long staircase of yellow bars climbs diagonally across the field.

00:36.000 --> 00:42.000
The frame tilts like a print and a pale blue note lands on a square target.

00:42.000 --> 00:48.000
The tilted frame holds two square targets with pink bars beneath them.

00:48.000 --> 00:51.000
White bars drop down the field towards the line near the bottom.
